title: 'statement-store: warn when the v2 DHT path runs on the libp2p backend'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    A node started with `--statement-v2-dht` and `--network-backend libp2p` now logs a warning.
    The v2 DHT path learns peers only from litep2p discovery and identify events, so on libp2p it
    reserves and dials no statement peer.
crates:
- name: sc-network-statement
  bump: patch
